WEBVTT

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:08.300
Please!

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.469
Thank you!

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:12.179
They're working hard, huh?

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:13.680
Yes, they are.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.200
I'm home!

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.285
Huh?!

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.954
Oof.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:41.375
Huh? What's going on...?

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:47.256
From now on, we can live under one roof,
just us siblings, right? Big Brother Kyotaro!

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:01.562
<i>Writing down my aspirations</i>

00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:04.314
<i>For the day when they will come true</i>

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:09.653
<i>The time has come when</i>
<i>I want to turn to the page I marked</i>

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:15.117
<i>Although there are things I lose</i>
<i>sight of with everything that happens</i>

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.493
<i>Hey, it's all right</i>

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:20.414
<i>The start I'm embarking on is unexpected</i>

00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:23.250
<i>The memory that you couldn't erase</i>

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.919
<i>Even that sad memory</i>

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:29.965
<i>I'll give it a different, happier reading</i>

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:35.596
<i>I feel like just that will change everything</i>

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:36.722
<i>All Right</i>

00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:39.933
<i>So come now, the way you are!</i>

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.769
<i>Don't hide your weak self</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:43.770
<i>On my Sheep </i>

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:47.441
<i>Let's meet riding on a dream</i>

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:53.363
<i>Even just calling your name as</i>
<i>I write in this book of adventures</i>

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:56.200
<i>I'm not lost anymore</i>

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.912
<i>Let's start our journey together</i>

00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:07.669
<i>Yes... more of you and me!</i>

00:02:18.597 --> 00:02:23.602
"Episode 10: Confession"
Big Brother, have some of my home-cooked food.

00:02:24.311 --> 00:02:30.234
Wow, I'm so moved by all this elaborate food.

00:02:30.234 --> 00:02:34.279
I boiled the water, which is
essentially home cooking, isn't it?

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:36.865
What does "essentially" mean to you?

00:02:41.954 --> 00:02:43.747
Why did it turn out like this?

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:46.250
It's fine, isn't it? We're siblings,

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:51.797
and I thought it was annoying going back
and forth between rooms to watch TV.

00:02:57.636 --> 00:02:58.846
What?

00:02:58.846 --> 00:03:04.017
Nothing... I was just wondering
why I didn't remember you until now.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:08.522
I was only your sister for about three months.

00:03:09.773 --> 00:03:14.528
I see... So that's how it was...

00:03:14.528 --> 00:03:20.534
Before my dad disappeared, and what
could be called my "family" crumbled...

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:31.378
Just for a short time, Kodachi was my sister.

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:40.637
She was the daughter of one of my
dad's wives, but I don't remember which one...

00:03:40.637 --> 00:03:45.142
No one played with her,
and she was always alone.

00:03:49.438 --> 00:03:57.654
The house servants became interested in her
because she lived holding her breath, all alone.

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:17.049
Someone...

00:04:17.508 --> 00:04:19.051
Help me...

00:04:20.469 --> 00:04:22.471
Hey, Kakei!

00:04:23.805 --> 00:04:26.099
What are you spacing out for?

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:28.101
Oh, uh...

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:30.187
Your noodles are getting soggy!

00:04:30.187 --> 00:04:31.605
Right...

00:04:32.814 --> 00:04:34.149
Nagi.

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:41.323
Hey, why so familiar all of a sudden?

00:04:41.323 --> 00:04:45.077
I was just thinking I used
to call you that in the past.

00:04:45.869 --> 00:04:48.997
The past is the past!

00:04:59.967 --> 00:05:03.303
How can you say that so calmly?

00:05:10.644 --> 00:05:14.231
Senri, I won't let you sleep tonight...

00:05:16.108 --> 00:05:21.363
Now, let's start our all-night
movie marathon at Senri's house!

00:05:21.363 --> 00:05:23.448
Yay!

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:27.411
The critics said you'll need
a lot of tissues for this movie.

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:33.041
This is the first time I've
had so much fun in my life.

00:05:33.041 --> 00:05:38.130
Oh no, you can't be satisfied with just this.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:42.843
There's still Minafes and
waves of other fun things coming.

00:05:42.843 --> 00:05:44.261
Yeah.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:57.524
Hey, Big Brother, it's been a while,
but do you want to bathe together?

00:05:57.524 --> 00:06:02.863
Stop acting like that. Anyway,
we didn't bathe together in the past, either.

00:06:02.863 --> 00:06:09.119
We didn't? Oh well. I'll go first, then.

00:06:21.131 --> 00:06:22.841
This is lame.

00:06:22.841 --> 00:06:28.347
If I become a Shepherd,
he'll just forget everything anyway.

00:06:28.347 --> 00:06:32.809
It's fine if I'm the only one who remembers.

00:06:32.809 --> 00:06:36.522
Stop it! What are you doing to Nagi?

00:06:44.112 --> 00:06:47.574
Um, are you okay...?

00:06:47.574 --> 00:06:48.992
I'm fine.

00:06:48.992 --> 00:06:52.412
Big Brother Kyotaro, why...?

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:56.416
I can't just ignore that.

00:07:05.384 --> 00:07:06.718
Aw, jeez!

00:07:25.529 --> 00:07:28.031
H-Hey, Shirasaki.

00:07:28.031 --> 00:07:31.743
S-Sorry for coming so suddenly...

00:07:40.002 --> 00:07:42.671
What's wrong? It's so late.

00:07:42.671 --> 00:07:44.798
Y-Yeah...

00:07:44.798 --> 00:07:46.633
Is it hard to say?

00:07:46.633 --> 00:07:50.512
It's not... well, it <i>is</i>...

00:07:50.512 --> 00:07:52.264
U-Um...

00:07:52.264 --> 00:07:54.349
Y-Yes?

00:07:54.349 --> 00:07:59.813
My... my... my...!

00:07:59.813 --> 00:08:01.190
Your...?

00:08:02.357 --> 00:08:06.820
My <i>curry </i>tastes good
because I put yogurt in it...

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.906
I-Is that right?

00:08:08.906 --> 00:08:10.073
No, that's not it!

00:08:10.073 --> 00:08:11.950
Huh?

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:15.495
I-I'll say it right this time...

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:16.872
Okay.

00:08:18.624 --> 00:08:24.046
Will you... Will you be my boyfriend?

00:08:24.046 --> 00:08:25.464
Huh?!

00:08:31.678 --> 00:08:35.307
I'm glad I got it out.

00:08:39.019 --> 00:08:42.272
Boyfriend, huh?

00:08:42.523 --> 00:08:45.442
Hey, you...

00:08:45.442 --> 00:08:49.404
Stop... talking... already...

00:08:53.325 --> 00:08:55.702
"Narumi City Central Hospital"

00:08:55.869 --> 00:08:58.747
Is this your boyfriend, Sis?

00:08:58.747 --> 00:09:00.541
Y-Yeah...

00:09:00.541 --> 00:09:03.043
Nice to meet you. I'm Kakei.

00:09:03.043 --> 00:09:06.296
Nice to meet you. I'm her little sister, Sayori.

00:09:06.296 --> 00:09:08.465
Thanks for taking the time to come today.

00:09:08.465 --> 00:09:13.303
All she talks about is you,
so I wanted to meet you once...

00:09:13.303 --> 00:09:16.932
I-I talk about other people!

00:09:16.932 --> 00:09:20.227
Remember? I told you about Kyoko,
the girl handing out flyers, too!

00:09:20.227 --> 00:09:22.062
That's still me.

00:09:22.062 --> 00:09:27.025
By the way, Kakei, is my
sister being a proper girlfriend?

00:09:27.025 --> 00:09:28.902
She's wasted on me, you know.

00:09:28.902 --> 00:09:32.155
D-Don't say that, Kakei!

00:09:32.155 --> 00:09:35.409
Please take care of my sister.

00:09:35.409 --> 00:09:36.201
Yeah...

00:09:36.201 --> 00:09:40.914
She's scatterbrained,
but she's kind and good at cooking.

00:09:40.914 --> 00:09:43.292
I'm sure she'd make a good wife.

00:09:43.292 --> 00:09:46.128
S-Stop, Sayori. Don't say that!

00:09:46.128 --> 00:09:49.089
Wait, Sis, that's the nurse call button!

00:09:49.089 --> 00:09:52.176
Huh? Ah, sorry!

00:09:53.927 --> 00:09:56.555
--I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
--It's a lie, isn't it?

00:09:56.555 --> 00:09:57.598
Huh?

00:09:57.598 --> 00:10:00.350
That you're my sister's boyfriend.

00:10:04.271 --> 00:10:10.152
I know that everything she
says about Shiomi Academy

00:10:10.152 --> 00:10:13.780
is just made up to make me feel better...

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:14.823
That's...

00:10:14.823 --> 00:10:18.911
Oh, I'm not blaming you or anything, you know.

00:10:18.911 --> 00:10:23.165
I wanted to meet you today so I could thank you.

00:10:23.165 --> 00:10:24.333
Thank me?

00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:29.296
For my introverted sister to decide
to put on something like Minafes...

00:10:29.296 --> 00:10:33.550
I think it's because you
and the others are with her.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:38.388
We were brought together because of Shirasaki...

00:10:38.388 --> 00:10:40.682
I'm grateful to her.

00:10:40.682 --> 00:10:42.059
Really?

00:10:46.813 --> 00:10:49.483
She got really mad at me...

00:10:49.483 --> 00:10:51.235
Sis, I heard!

00:10:51.235 --> 00:10:52.694
Huh? Heard what?

00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:57.324
That Kakei loves everything about you.

00:10:57.324 --> 00:10:59.243
You guys are so in love.

00:11:00.786 --> 00:11:06.625
--L-L-L-Love... Love... Love...
--Uh, Shirasaki?

00:11:07.376 --> 00:11:10.462
Shirasaki! Hey, are you all right?

00:11:13.507 --> 00:11:16.844
Please take care of my sister from now on, too.

00:11:19.179 --> 00:11:24.601
Sorry for making you come with me today...

00:11:24.601 --> 00:11:29.189
It's okay. It was fun getting
a chance to talk to Sayori.

00:11:30.315 --> 00:11:31.900
Kakei...

00:11:33.777 --> 00:11:39.241
To thank you for today, if it's not a bother...

00:11:39.241 --> 00:11:42.160
Can I go over to your house?

00:11:44.329 --> 00:11:45.163
Huh?

00:11:53.088 --> 00:11:54.715
Welcome home.

00:11:57.134 --> 00:11:59.553
What's wrong? Why are you so flustered?

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.349
Sorry, Kodachi!

00:12:06.101 --> 00:12:08.437
Hey, what's going on all of a sudden?

00:12:08.437 --> 00:12:10.522
Stay here for a while!

00:12:10.522 --> 00:12:11.940
Huh?

00:12:14.985 --> 00:12:18.363
W-Welcome...

00:12:18.363 --> 00:12:20.657
I'm coming in.

00:12:34.379 --> 00:12:35.297
Oh?

00:12:35.297 --> 00:12:36.298
What?

00:12:36.298 --> 00:12:39.384
Kakei, you use such a cute cup?

00:12:39.384 --> 00:12:46.099
Oh! Yeah... Decoration
is the spice of life, right?

00:12:53.023 --> 00:12:56.068
Kakei, should I make the flavor stronger?

00:12:56.068 --> 00:12:59.071
Uh, yeah...

00:12:59.071 --> 00:13:00.531
Okay.

00:13:01.281 --> 00:13:04.368
Hey, wait! I liked that one!

00:13:05.285 --> 00:13:07.829
I'll buy you a new one later...

00:13:08.288 --> 00:13:09.373
Did you say something?

00:13:09.373 --> 00:13:13.168
Y-Yeah... I think there's
a cat on the balcony...

00:13:13.168 --> 00:13:15.128
Meow.

00:13:15.128 --> 00:13:17.005
S-See?

00:13:17.005 --> 00:13:18.757
Oh, there is!

00:13:21.552 --> 00:13:26.098
Hi, I'm the home-wrecking cat who was
kicked out when the real wife came home!

00:13:26.098 --> 00:13:27.099
S-Sorry...

00:13:27.099 --> 00:13:27.975
Kakei!

00:13:27.975 --> 00:13:29.101
Y-Yes?

00:13:29.101 --> 00:13:31.603
I got this email from the Shepherd...

00:13:31.603 --> 00:13:32.938
Huh?

00:13:35.566 --> 00:13:38.569
"Showing off your good wife skills
by feeding him home-cooked food?

00:13:38.569 --> 00:13:41.321
No way, that's way too blatant."

00:13:41.321 --> 00:13:44.658
It seems kind of different
from usual, doesn't it?

00:13:44.658 --> 00:13:47.286
The contents are really specific, too.

00:13:47.286 --> 00:13:49.580
<i>Kodachi</i>...

00:13:52.165 --> 00:13:56.461
I want all groups who want
to participate to be able to.

00:13:56.461 --> 00:13:59.298
If we turn people down
because there's not enough time,

00:13:59.298 --> 00:14:01.675
we'd be the same as the Shiomi Festival.

00:14:01.675 --> 00:14:05.721
Can't we just rent Appllio for longer?

00:14:05.721 --> 00:14:08.015
That'll cost money, though.

00:14:08.015 --> 00:14:11.393
We could lose thousands of dollars.

00:14:14.897 --> 00:14:19.359
We just have to make sure
we get enough customers.

00:14:19.985 --> 00:14:22.613
Then it'd be more interesting if we tried.

00:14:22.613 --> 00:14:23.322
Everyone!

00:14:23.322 --> 00:14:24.781
Don't be stupid!

00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:27.826
Tamamo...

00:14:27.826 --> 00:14:31.330
If I'm working on it,
I won't let us go into the red!

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:35.125
Tamamo... Thank you!

00:14:43.091 --> 00:14:46.011
Sayori? What is it?

00:14:46.011 --> 00:14:48.430
You're going to be temporarily
discharged from the hospital?

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.431
Okay!

00:14:49.431 --> 00:14:50.933
That's great.

00:14:57.648 --> 00:15:01.318
Hey... It's not Shirasaki again, is it?

00:15:01.318 --> 00:15:04.696
I-I don't know...
Just go to the balcony for now.

00:15:04.696 --> 00:15:06.615
What?!

00:15:06.615 --> 00:15:09.117
Hey, let's make a scene.

00:15:09.117 --> 00:15:10.118
Huh?

00:15:10.118 --> 00:15:12.079
Okay, coming!

00:15:12.079 --> 00:15:13.080
Huh?!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:14.331
Hey!

00:15:14.331 --> 00:15:16.583
Kodachi, don't be so hasty!

00:15:16.583 --> 00:15:19.419
Sh-Shirasaki!

00:15:19.419 --> 00:15:20.546
Did you need something?

00:15:20.546 --> 00:15:26.760
U-Um... Sayori, my sister,
said she just had to see Kakei...

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.762
Sh-Shirasaki, it's not what you think.

00:15:28.762 --> 00:15:30.347
Kakei!

00:15:30.347 --> 00:15:33.851
Oh, Sayori... I'm glad
you could be discharged...

00:15:33.851 --> 00:15:37.771
Why is there a girl in your room?

00:15:37.771 --> 00:15:40.274
Th-That's...

00:15:40.274 --> 00:15:43.819
Let's hear what you have to say.

00:15:47.239 --> 00:15:52.536
Kodachi, was it?
What is your relationship with Kakei?

00:15:52.536 --> 00:15:55.372
Hm, well...

00:15:55.372 --> 00:15:57.791
Sayori, don't ask something like that...

00:15:57.791 --> 00:15:59.710
It has nothing to do you with, Sis!

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.296
R-Right! Huh?

00:16:02.296 --> 00:16:04.882
Well, Kodachi?

00:16:04.882 --> 00:16:09.928
Our relationship, huh? Hey, what should I say?

00:16:09.928 --> 00:16:11.638
Well...

00:16:14.641 --> 00:16:17.561
Kodachi is my...

00:16:21.732 --> 00:16:23.859
My little sister!

00:16:28.363 --> 00:16:29.364
Huh?

00:16:29.364 --> 00:16:33.785
Kakei... That's the worst
excuse you could make, you know.

00:16:33.785 --> 00:16:36.705
Uh, wait, but...

00:16:36.705 --> 00:16:38.290
You're so mean, Kyotaro!

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.751
Calling me your little sister!

00:16:40.751 --> 00:16:45.756
After you came after
me so violently last night...

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.634
Kodachi! You need to stop this!

00:16:48.634 --> 00:16:51.178
Oh, so she's your sister...

00:16:51.178 --> 00:16:52.179
Huh?

00:16:52.179 --> 00:16:56.558
Huh? But you two are in
the same year, aren't you?

00:16:56.558 --> 00:16:59.645
Oh, Kakei, you kidder...

00:17:01.605 --> 00:17:02.689
Shirasaki...?

00:17:02.689 --> 00:17:05.234
Sis, are you okay with this?

00:17:05.943 --> 00:17:07.152
Sayori?

00:17:07.152 --> 00:17:11.698
I know... that Kakei isn't your boyfriend...

00:17:11.698 --> 00:17:12.824
What?!

00:17:12.824 --> 00:17:17.579
But... it's not a lie
that you like Kakei, is it?

00:17:18.539 --> 00:17:19.831
Huh?

00:17:19.831 --> 00:17:20.999
But Kakei has...

00:17:20.999 --> 00:17:22.334
That doesn't matter!

00:17:22.334 --> 00:17:25.045
What's important is your feelings, right?

00:17:25.045 --> 00:17:27.589
Sayori... If you get too worked up...

00:17:27.589 --> 00:17:32.761
If you like Kakei,
you can't give up! You can't...

00:17:33.262 --> 00:17:37.015
Sayori? Sayori!

00:17:37.015 --> 00:17:39.226
--Sayori!
--Sayori!

00:17:39.226 --> 00:17:40.602
Does your chest feel tight?

00:17:40.602 --> 00:17:42.896
That's why I said not to get worked up...

00:17:42.896 --> 00:17:46.859
Hang on! I-I'll call an ambulance...

00:17:46.859 --> 00:17:47.818
I'll do it!

00:17:47.818 --> 00:17:50.320
Sayori! Open your eyes!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.782
Sayori! Please! Sayori!

00:17:54.408 --> 00:17:56.493
Kodachi, do me a favor!

00:17:56.493 --> 00:17:57.452
Huh?

00:17:57.452 --> 00:18:00.956
Please take Sayori to
the hospital with your power!

00:18:00.956 --> 00:18:01.832
What?

00:18:01.832 --> 00:18:03.584
Please, Kodachi!

00:18:05.002 --> 00:18:07.838
Fine, I'll do it.

00:18:07.838 --> 00:18:11.633
Sayori... Sayori...

00:18:11.633 --> 00:18:13.886
Kodachi...?

00:18:13.886 --> 00:18:16.471
I'll do something about it.

00:18:21.727 --> 00:18:22.936
Let's go.

00:18:25.939 --> 00:18:28.734
Don't lose, Sis...

00:18:32.613 --> 00:18:33.780
Sayori...

00:18:36.575 --> 00:18:39.536
Kakei...?

00:18:47.669 --> 00:18:52.591
Sis, why am I here...?

00:18:52.591 --> 00:18:56.762
Don't worry about it. It's going to be fine.

00:19:02.267 --> 00:19:05.562
It looks like Sayori's condition is stable.

00:19:05.562 --> 00:19:06.813
I see.

00:19:06.813 --> 00:19:09.274
Thanks, Kakei.

00:19:09.274 --> 00:19:11.568
You should thank Kodachi--

00:19:11.568 --> 00:19:14.780
Or not, I guess...

00:19:17.616 --> 00:19:19.159
Were you surprised?

00:19:19.159 --> 00:19:23.664
Yeah. I never thought
books could be used to travel...

00:19:23.664 --> 00:19:27.793
Do you think you can explain it to me?

00:19:27.793 --> 00:19:33.006
Kodachi and I... are kind
of like Shepherds, in a way.

00:19:34.925 --> 00:19:37.427
Then, all the emails we've been getting...

00:19:37.427 --> 00:19:42.140
That wasn't me. There are other Shepherds, too.

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:47.062
I'm still in training, so all
I can do is see a fuzzy future.

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:50.899
The future... Then during that accident...

00:19:50.899 --> 00:19:55.821
At that time, I wasn't a
Shepherd or anything yet, though.

00:20:00.534 --> 00:20:02.786
I expected this...

00:20:06.456 --> 00:20:13.088
When you find out that someone
you interacted with as a regular person

00:20:13.088 --> 00:20:16.925
is actually some strange being, there's no
way your relationship could stay the same.

00:20:24.099 --> 00:20:25.309
Kakei!

00:20:27.019 --> 00:20:31.064
Kakei... are you going away?

00:20:31.064 --> 00:20:34.610
No, I'm not going anywhere...

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:39.781
Everyone will just forget their memories of me.

00:20:41.116 --> 00:20:44.828
That's the same as going away...

00:20:45.954 --> 00:20:47.706
Don't go.

00:20:51.126 --> 00:20:53.378
Don't go anywhere!

00:20:54.338 --> 00:20:56.340
Shirasaki...

00:21:02.179 --> 00:21:04.431
I want you to stay with me forever...

00:21:05.641 --> 00:21:08.685
I like you, Kakei...

00:21:22.032 --> 00:21:23.283
Shirasaki...

00:21:23.575 --> 00:21:25.702
Um, well...

00:21:25.702 --> 00:21:28.288
It's not that I want you
to go out with me or anything.

00:21:28.288 --> 00:21:31.667
I just like you as a human,
or maybe a living thing...

00:21:31.667 --> 00:21:34.545
Oh! Oh, I see...

00:21:34.545 --> 00:21:36.338
So please, don't worry about it.

00:21:36.338 --> 00:21:39.132
R-Right.

00:21:39.132 --> 00:21:41.885
Well, see you tomorrow then.

00:21:41.885 --> 00:21:44.555
Yeah, see you tomorrow.

00:22:03.574 --> 00:22:05.784
Um... good morning...

00:22:05.784 --> 00:22:07.411
Hey...

00:22:07.411 --> 00:22:09.621
Kakei!

00:22:10.497 --> 00:22:11.915
I-It's terrible!

00:22:11.915 --> 00:22:14.543
Our clubroom is... it's...

00:22:18.297 --> 00:22:19.381
You people...

00:22:19.381 --> 00:22:22.009
Oh, hello.

00:22:22.009 --> 00:22:23.302
What are you doing here?

00:22:23.302 --> 00:22:25.929
What do you mean? We're doing club activities.

00:22:25.929 --> 00:22:28.515
Because all of us are Library Club members.

00:22:28.515 --> 00:22:32.853
Nonsense. I don't remember allowing you to join!

00:22:32.853 --> 00:22:36.398
That's 'cause we joined last year.

00:22:36.398 --> 00:22:37.900
What?

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:40.652
You guys were inactive, right?

00:22:40.652 --> 00:22:44.239
We thought we'd be good
club members from now on!

00:22:45.532 --> 00:22:47.492
Please leave the clubroom!

00:22:47.492 --> 00:22:53.040
Sorry, but at the member meeting earlier,
I became the president.

00:22:53.749 --> 00:22:59.004
Look, here's the official document...
We had more than 3/4 of the club members.

00:23:00.339 --> 00:23:02.549
You guys should be the ones to leave!

00:23:08.430 --> 00:23:11.642
"The Shepherd will not allow your existence."

00:23:12.184 --> 00:23:13.602
"Frozen food 10% off!"

00:23:13.602 --> 00:23:15.270
Today's dinner will be...

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:18.524
Doing this makes me feel more
like a newlywed than a little sister.

00:23:18.524 --> 00:23:20.442
"Noodles"
Oh, these instant noodles are new!

00:23:20.442 --> 00:23:22.444
"Pizza"
This frozen pizza tastes good, too!

00:23:22.444 --> 00:23:23.654
Kodachi.

00:23:23.654 --> 00:23:24.488
I've been watching you this whole time,

00:23:24.488 --> 00:23:26.949
but if you want to act like a newlywed,
I don't think those are good choices.

00:23:26.949 --> 00:23:29.785
Seeing his wife who can't cook cut
herself while trying hard for his sake

00:23:29.785 --> 00:23:31.078
is like a dream come true for a guy.

00:23:32.246 --> 00:23:33.288
"Next time: Decision"
It's weird seeing you at the supermarket, Boss!

00:23:33.288 --> 00:23:37.046
"Next time: Decision"
Are you listening?
